        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "At home and abroad he overcame, by the name of Jesus, the power of devils; on Easter Sunday, at Wurzburg, he gave sight to a blind woman by breathing on her eyes; he discovered some of the bodies of the eleven thousand virgins, and those of the two Ewalds, martyrs, and placed his church at Prémontré under their protection.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            575
